  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Inclusive and Competitive Horticulture Businesses in Tanzania&apos;s Southern Highlands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective is to improve the performance of Tanzania&apos;s horticulture sector, the inclusion of smallholder farmers in it, and its contribution to job creation and nutrition security. The Specific Objectives are:1 - To increase the profitability of the horticulture sector for smallholders and traders in Iringa, Njombe, Mbeya, Songwe and Katavi regions; 2 - To increase competitiveness of the horticulture sector in Iringa, Njombe, Mbeya, Songwe and Katavi regions.</narrative>
  </description>
